squo;s 6 grids. On that middle, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, and in 2025 it was 30% of normal. April to May is the wettest pair at 9.80 inches, and in 2025 it ran 206% of normal on the middle. Grid 19349 had its driest year in 1963 at 56%.</p>"}
